{"id":"php-patrones-navegacion-parametrizada-y-ficha-detallada-get-e-is-numeric","title":"PHP - Patrones - Navegación Parametrizada y Ficha Detallada (GET e is_numeric)","topic":"php","topicLabel":"PHP","tags":["aprendizaje","php","patrones","navegacion","desarrollo"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":3,"text":"Medidas de Seguridad y Control del Flujo:","id":"medidas-de-seguridad-y-control-del-flujo"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"},{"depth":3,"text":"Implementación Completa de la Ficha Detallada (pelicula.php)","id":"implementacion-completa-de-la-ficha-detallada-pelicula-php"}],"readingMins":3,"codeBlocks":1,"words":597,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>La <strong>Navegación Parametrizada</strong> es un patrón de diseño arquitectónico en desarrollo web en el que una única página PHP (la plantilla o template) genera de forma dinámica el contenido completo de una ficha basándose en parámetros pasados en la URL (parámetros de consulta o Query Strings).</p>\n<p>Por ejemplo, en lugar de crear archivos individuales estáticos e insostenibles como <code>matrix.php</code> o <code>avatar.php</code>, creamos un único archivo lógico <strong><code>pelicula.php</code></strong> y cargamos los datos según el identificador de película requerido:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>pelicula.php?id=8</code> (Carga la película con <code>id_pelicula = 8</code>)</li>\n<li><code>pelicula.php?id=15</code> (Carga la película con <code>id_pelicula = 15</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"medidas-de-seguridad-y-control-del-flujo\" class=\"note__h\">Medidas de Seguridad y Control del Flujo:</h3><p>Para evitar fallos lógicos, inyecciones de datos maliciosos o errores fatales de PHP en el servidor, se debe validar de manera estricta cada parámetro que viaja por la URL antes de utilizarlo:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Existencia (<code>isset</code>):</strong> Comprobar que el parámetro realmente se haya enviado en la URL (<code>$_GET[&quot;id&quot;]</code>). Si no es así, la carga del script debe detenerse (<code>die</code> o redirección segura a <code>index.php</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Valor Numérico (<code>is_numeric</code>):</strong> Los identificadores en la base de datos son de tipo entero. Si el usuario modifica la URL escribiendo cadenas de texto (ej: <code>?id=hola</code>), la validación debe rechazarlo inmediatamente.</li>\n<li><strong>Conversión de Tipo (<code>intval</code> o <code>(int)</code>):</strong> Castear explícitamente el valor a tipo entero como capa final de saneado.</li>\n<li><strong>Vinculación Segura con Tipo <code>i</code> (Integer):</strong> En consultas preparadas de MySQLi, en lugar de vincular el parámetro como string (<code>&quot;s&quot;</code>), se debe vincular con el especificador de tipo numérico <strong><code>&quot;i&quot;</code></strong>:<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">php</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">bind_param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span>);</code></pre></div></li>\n<li><strong>Existencia de Registro (<code>num_rows</code>):</strong> Incluso si el ID recibido es un número válido (ej: <code>?id=9999</code>), puede ocurrir que no exista ese registro en la base de datos. Debemos evaluar si la consulta devolvió filas (<code>$resultado-&gt;num_rows === 0</code>) antes de intentar renderizar datos nulos.</li>\n</ol>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--tip\" data-callout=\"tip\">\n<p class=\"callout__title\">Consejo</p>\n<p><strong>Alternativa moderna con <code>filter_input()</code>:</strong>\nEn lugar de combinar <code>isset($_GET[&quot;id&quot;]) &amp;&amp; is_numeric($_GET[&quot;id&quot;])</code>, PHP ofrece <code>filter_input()</code> con el filtro <code>FILTER_VALIDATE_INT</code>. Esta función comprueba la existencia de la variable y valida que sea un entero válido en una sola instrucción:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">php</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">filter_input</span>(INPUT_GET, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id&quot;</span>, FILTER_VALIDATE_INT);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span> || <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ID no enviado o no es un entero válido positivo</span>\n}</code></pre></div>\n</aside>\n\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><h3 id=\"implementacion-completa-de-la-ficha-detallada-pelicula-php\" class=\"note__h\">Implementación Completa de la Ficha Detallada (<code>pelicula.php</code>)</h3><p>El siguiente script procesa el parámetro de manera segura, realiza dos consultas relacionales (una para la película y otra para el reparto cruzado N:M), embebe el tráiler de YouTube y genera el layout dinámico de la ficha:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">php</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;?php</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">require_once</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;conexion.php&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1. Validar la existencia e integridad del ID en la URL</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">isset</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id&quot;</span>]) || !<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">is_numeric</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id&quot;</span>])) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Location: index.php&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">exit</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">int</span>)<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id&quot;</span>];\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 2. CONSULTA A: Obtener los detalles de la película</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$sql_pelicula</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;SELECT titulo, director, genero, fecha_estreno, trailer_url, descripcion, imagen \n                 FROM peliculas \n                 WHERE id_pelicula = ?&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span> = <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$conexion</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">prepare</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$sql_pelicula</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">die</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error al preparar la consulta.&quot;</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">bind_param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">execute</span>();\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$resultado</span> = <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">get_result</span>();\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Comprobar si la película realmente existe</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$resultado</span>-&gt;num_rows === <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">close</span>();\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$conexion</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">close</span>();\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">die</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;La película solicitada no existe.&quot;</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$pelicula</span> = <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$resultado</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">fetch_assoc</span>();\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">close</span>();\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 3. CONSULTA B: Obtener el reparto (INNER JOIN N:M)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$sql_reparto</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\n    SELECT a.nombre, a.apellidos, pa.personaje \n    FROM peliculas_actores pa\n    INNER JOIN actores a ON pa.id_actor = a.id_actor\n    WHERE pa.id_pelicula = ?\n&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt_reparto</span> = <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$conexion</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">prepare</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$sql_reparto</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt_reparto</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">bind_param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt_reparto</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">execute</span>();\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$reparto</span> = <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt_reparto</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">get_result</span>();\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">?&gt;</span>\n\n&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;es&quot;</span>&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span>&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;<span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;?php</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">htmlspecialchars</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$pelicula</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;titulo&quot;</span>]); <span class=\"hljs-meta\">?&gt;</span>&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;link rel=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> href=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;estilos.css&quot;</span>&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n\n&lt;div <span class=\"hljs-class\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">contenedor</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">principal</span>&quot;&gt;\n    \n    &lt;!-- <span class=\"hljs-title\">Bot</span>ó<span class=\"hljs-title\">n</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Volver</span> --&gt;\n    &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">href</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">index</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span>&quot; <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">boton</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">volver</span>&quot;&gt;&amp;<span class=\"hljs-title\">larr</span>; <span class=\"hljs-title\">Volver</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">al</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">cat</span>á<span class=\"hljs-title\">logo</span>&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">a</span>&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- <span class=\"hljs-title\">Layout</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">con</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Flexbox</span> (<span class=\"hljs-title\">Poster</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Izquierda</span> / <span class=\"hljs-title\">Datos</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Derecha</span>) --&gt;\n    &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">ficha</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>&quot;&gt;\n        \n        &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">columna</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">izquierda</span>&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> \n            $<span class=\"hljs-title\">imagen</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title\">empty</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">imagen</span>&quot;]) ? &quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">sin_imagen</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title\">jpg</span>&quot; : $<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">imagen</span>&quot;]; \n            ?&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">cartel</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">ficha</span>&quot; <span class=\"hljs-title\">src</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">imagenes</span>/&lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">imagen</span>); ?&gt;&quot; <span class=\"hljs-title\">alt</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">Cartel</span>&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span>&gt;\n\n        &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">columna</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">derecha</span>&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">h1</span>&gt;&lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">titulo</span>&quot;]); ?&gt;&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">h1</span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">strong</span>&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">Director</span>:&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">strong</span>&gt; &lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">director</span>&quot;]); ?&gt;&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">strong</span>&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">G</span>é<span class=\"hljs-title\">nero</span>:&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">strong</span>&gt; &lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">genero</span>&quot;]); ?&gt;&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">strong</span>&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">Estreno</span>:&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">strong</span>&gt; &lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">fecha_estreno</span>&quot;]); ?&gt;&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;\n            \n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">sinopsis</span>&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">h3</span>&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">Sinopsis</span>&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">h3</span>&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;&lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">nl2br</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">descripcion</span>&quot;])); ?&gt;&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">p</span>&gt;\n            &lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span>&gt;\n        &lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span>&gt;\n\n    &lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span>&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- <span class=\"hljs-title\">Secci</span>ó<span class=\"hljs-title\">n</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">del</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Tr</span>á<span class=\"hljs-title\">iler</span> (<span class=\"hljs-title\">Iframe</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">de</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">YouTube</span>) --&gt;\n    &lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-title\">empty</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">trailer_url</span>&quot;])): ?&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">class</span>=&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">seccion</span>-<span class=\"hljs-title\">video</span>&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">h2</span>&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">Tr</span>á<span class=\"hljs-title\">iler</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Oficial</span>&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-title\">h2</span>&gt;\n            &lt;!-- <span class=\"hljs-title\">allowfullscreen</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">permite</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">la</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">reproducci</span>ó<span class=\"hljs-title\">n</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">en</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">pantalla</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">completa</span> --&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"hljs-title\">iframe</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">width</span>=&quot;100%&quot; <span class=\"hljs-title\">height</span>=&quot;450&quot; <span class=\"hljs-title\">src</span>=&quot;&lt;?<span class=\"hljs-title\">php</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">htmlspecialchars</span>($<span class=\"hljs-title\">pelicula</span>[&quot;<span class=\"hljs-title\">trailer_url</span>&quot;]); ?&gt;&quot; <span class=\"hljs-title\">allowfullscreen</span>&gt;&lt;/<span class